<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mahongezo</para>
  <para style="toc1">MAHONGEZO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mahongezo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Maho</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAHONGEZO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Mahongezo ni kitabu cha ngelo kikulonga mbuli yo kumoligwa kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Mwandisi wa Mahongezo hakukelavanya, mna wawandisi watuhu wa kale we Kiyahudi na want'hu wakumhuwila Kilisito wahuwila kugamba mlotezi Yelemia niye awandikaga. Want'hu awa wahuwila ivo kwaviya kitabu icho kinula ulosi wa kumoligwa pele kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Mafani vadahika chawandikwagwa mwo mwaka 586 aho Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa, umwo Yelusalemu wize umoligwe. Mna vadahika ni aho wize uzengwe uhya niyo Nyumba ya Mnungu yaikwa kwajili ya Mnungu, aho mwaka 516 umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Vadahika kitabu hicho chawandikagwa ni mnt'hu ekalaga hagihi no lupisi lwo kumoligwa kwo mzi uwo, mwo mwaka 586 aho Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Kitabu chose cha Mahongezo chalagisa kinyulu kwa want'hu wa Yelusalemu. Hamwenga na kugamba Yelusalemu yamoligwa na kukump'hukilwa ni fyo dya watowani wa Babeli, mna muwandisi we kitabu iki cha mahongezo awandika kugamba, aya yalailaga kwajili Mnungu andaga akawasulumiza want'hu wa si ya Yuda (mnango wa 1:12). Mungu awasulumizaga want'hu Yuda kwa kwombokela watowani wa Wababeli awo waikump'hukilaga isi iyo. Mwandisi uyu ywe kitabu cha Mahongezo akei akumbukila uhuilwa wa Mnungu. Mwe kinyulu chakwe alonga kugamba, lukunde lwa ZUMBE holukudunduga, naho kugamba mbazi za ZUMBE zikei zagendeela, (mnango 3:22). Kwo uheelo mwandisi we kitabu abindiliza kwa kumlombeza Mnungu awavuze want'hu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ayo yemndani mwe kitabu:</para>
  <para style="io">Utambalisi we kinyulu kwajili ya masulumizo ayo Mnungu awegaile want'hu wakwe na kumoligwa kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Mnango wa nk'hongo na wa kaidi</para>
  <para style="io">Mwandisi akumbukila uhuilwa wa Mungu na kulombeza wambizi. Mnango wa katatu.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuvuzagiza kutambalisa ikinyulu na masulumizo yaihile ya want'hu wa Yuda. Mnango wa kane.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwandisi abindiliza kwa kumlombeza Mungu awavuze want'hu wa si ya Yuda. Mnango wa shano.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Kinyulu cha want'hu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Kaula ivo vili mzi wamemile want'hu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Mna ivi haluse usigala howiina want'hu, haluse unda enga mvele afiilwe ni mgosiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Mwo lupisi lutuhu nokunda kumanyikisa mwe ziisi, yudya andaga malikia haluse kanda mtumwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Ailisa kwa usungu aho nekilo,masozi yakamhuluwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Hehali hata ywa kumsangalaza hata yumwenga mwa wambuyaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">wose wamdant'hiliza naho wanda wank'hondo wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Mwo kwajika makunt'ho na kudamanyisiswa ndima vidala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Yuda kasamizwa kwaviya yo kuhujilwa, haluse wekala mwa want'hu wa si nt'huhu naho hawapatile hant'hu ha kuhumula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Awo wose nawakawongola wawagwila wakanda mwe makunt'ho.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Hakuna yeyose akwiza kuvika mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">na wandele wakukema wana makunt'ho, zink'hili zakwe nazo hazina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Walavant'hambiko wakwe waila kwa usungu wana kike wawe nawo wana kinyulu, mzi wenye nao umwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Wank'hondo wako nawo wakilongoza naho wanda wapati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Kwaivo Zumbe Mnungu kawasulumizani kwaviya yo uwihi wenyu utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Wanawe watahigwa na kwigalwa hale.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Ukulu wose wa want'hu wa Sayuni uhalawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">Wakulu wakwe wanda enga kapala kazehuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">wawasumka wank'hondo wawe iivo no usokezi wawe.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Mwe mazuwa ya makunt'ho na kwangadika, Yelusalemu wakumbukila ukulu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Umwo wagwilagwa ni wank'hondo wawe, hahali yeyose ywa kuwambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Wank'hondo wakwe wasekaga kwa kuhumwa kwawe.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Yelusalemu kadamanya wavu wihile, naho niyo wanda msavu kwa wavu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Wose nawakautunya ivi haluse waubela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Kwaviya wakeona soni wenye wakakefisa.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Uwavu wakwe wonekaga pwilili, mna woho wenye hawaukaule uheelo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Ukugwa kwakwe nokunda kwa kwehela, hehali akudaha kuusangalaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Wagamba kaula Zumbe Mnungu makunt'ho yangu, kwaviya mnk'hondo wangu kanihuma.<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Wank'hondo wawahokaga vint'hu vakwe vose va yombe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">Ivo kuona want'hu wa hi Wayahudi wakengila mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">want'hu awo Zumbe Mnungu awalemelaga kunda hamwenga na want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Want'hu wakwe wose waila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">umwo wakazungula nk'hande na kusakanya vindolo vawe kwa nk'hande vileke wagendeele kunda wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">Kaula weye Zumbe Mnungu ufanyanye ivo hubeligwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />Nyuwe wagenda sila mwaona hi kint'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">“Kauleni hehali mta usungu enga miye!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">usungu aniigaile Zumbe Mnungu, mwe dizuwa dya maya yakwe yatendese.<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />Kulawa kulanga egalaga moto, niyo wanoka mwe mavuha yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">Anitegelaga mtego niyo wanigwila niyo anivuza kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">Na kunileka hyehelwa na kwituka msi wose.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />Wavu wangu unyinyigwa kwa hamwenga mwe mikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Zibula mwe singo yangu Zumbe kahausa ludole lwangu na kunigela mwo ludole lwa wadya hikudaha kuhigana nawo.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />Zumbe Mnungu awalemelaga watowani awo nawakanamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">naho abwelekezaga lupisi lwa kunisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Kuwakoma wabwanga wangu, na awahondaga enga kuminya divai want'hu wangu wa Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />Ayo nayo yalekile haila, masozi yeketika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Hehali mnt'hu yeyose wa kunisangalaza na hehali wa kunigela moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Wanangu walekigwa wakiwa kwaviya wank'hondo wangu wanihuma.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Naichulula mikono yangu mna hehali wa kunambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Zumbe Mnungu kalava sigilizi mwangu miye Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Wambwiya zangu wande wank'hondo wangu naho miye Yelusalemu hinda kinyala kwawe.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu kadamanya yakuwagila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Kwaviya hisaguka mwo ulosi wakwe naho nitegelezeni nyuwe want'hu wose, yakauleni masulumizo yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Wana kike wangu na wabwanga wangu watahigwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Nehiwetanga wambwiya zangu, mna woho wanilemelaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">Walavant'hambiko na wadala wangu wabanikila kwo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">wakazungula nk'hande yawe wenye yo kudya.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Kaula weye Zumbe Mnungu nivo nili mwe makunt'ho!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Moyo wangu usokela na muye wangu una kiyangayanga kwaviya hisaguka vihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Uko kuse kumema ukomi, kundani nako ni enga file du.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />“Want'hu weva ivo huila kwa usungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Mna hehali yeyose wa kunisangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Wank'hondo wangu wose weva ivo hukunt'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Welelwa mwa diya udamanye, nalombeza wigale mwe dizuwa dimwenga du vileke woho nawo waone enga ivo huona miye.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />Uwiihi wawe wose wize hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">uwadamanyile enga ivo unitendile miye kwaviya yo uwihi wangu wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Nehinda na kinyulu mwo moyo wangu na kunda na makunt'ho.”<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu Mnungy aisenela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Zumbe Mnungu kwa maya yakwe awagubikaga want'hu wa Sayuni na maihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Nt'hunyo ya Izilaeli haihali naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Mwe dizuwa dya maya yakwe haionele kinyemi hata Inyumba yakwe.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />Zumbe Mnungu abanangaga wikazi wa welekwa wa Yakobo aheina mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Kwa maya yakwe amolaga magomela ya want'hu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Awagelaga soni maseuta wake na wakulu wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Ludole lwose lwa Waizilaeli alubanangaga kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">alekaga kuwambiza umwo waduganaga na wank'hondo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">mwa maya yatendese awakomaga want'hu wa Yakobo enga moto ukoka pele.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Alasaga no msale wakwe enga mnk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">awakomaga wose kikeduvila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Mwe zikaya zetu want'hu wa Sayuni kandilisa na maya, mwa suwe yandaga enga moto.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Zumbe Mnungu kanda enga mnk'hondo, kwakoma want'hu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Mazumba yakwe yose kayamola, na magomela yakwe yose ya kiseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Kawatendela want'hu wa Yuda waile na kuhongezesa.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Kamola Nyumba yakwe umwo kikumvika enga kaheha kimwe kiunga ivo kakumoligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">Kalemeza mazuwa yose ya kinyemi ne dizuwa dyo kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">kwa maya yakwe yatendese kawalemela maseuta na walavant'hambiko.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />Zumbe Mnungu ahaonaga hikint'hu aho hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko, na kuilemela Inyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Nk'handula ye mazumba yakwe kawalekela wank'hondo wazimole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Wagutilaga umwo mwe Nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu enga vugo dya zuwa dya kinyemi.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />Zumbe Mnungu kalamula kumola nkh'andula za Sayuni, iwe kuita iwe tuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">Ivo akonganga kumola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">naho halekaga mpaka zink'handula na magomela vihongeze na kuzingiza.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Nk'hili zakwe zigwa hasi naho mihindo yakwe ya kilama ibanangwa na kuvunigwa vunigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Seuta na wakulu wakwe weyuko kwo utumwa mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Na sigilizi nayo ihalawa, walotezi wakwe hawakupata uwona naho kulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu. b<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Wadala wa Sayuni wekala hasi wakafanyanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">wakegela luvumbi mwe mitwi na kuvala mavalo ya gunia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Wana kike wa Yelusalemu wafunamiza mitwi yawe hasi.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />Meso yangu yavimba kwa kuila na moyo wangu nousokelesa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Moyo wangu una kinyulu kitendese kwaviya want'hu wangu wakomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">naho wana wakembe wazehuka na kubanika mwo mzi.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Wakawaiila wamami zawe, ikuhi nk'hande hegu mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">Uku wakalabila enga want'hu wazehuke mwe sila zo mzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">Na kubanikila mwe mikono ya wamami zawe.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Hugambilei weye Yelusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Huliganyize na mbwai? naho huliganyize na kint'hu kihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Hulangilize weye Sayuni wili wedi, niani nakadaha kukuhonya.<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />Walotezi wako wakusinyila maona yo udant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">Hawabunk'hule uwihi wako, vileke weye udamanye ayedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">Mna wakulotela maona yo udant'hi na ya kwazaganya.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Wagenda sila wose wakubela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">Wakuluvya weye Yelusalemu uku wakasingisa mitwi yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">“Togoleni mzi uno nuwo wandaga wedi kujink'ha mizi yose? Naho mzi wa kinyemi mwe si yose?”<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />Wank'hondo wako wose wakutowa kizumo na kukufyondola, naho waku gwegwejuila meno wakagamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">“heiye kimbananga kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">mwe dizuwa diya nekikagoja kwa nk'hwina haluse dibula naho kidiona!”<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />Zumbe Mnungu kakint'hiza yadya alaganaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">Enga ivo aikaga aho kale, abanangaga haheina mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">Awatendaga wank'hondo wande na kinyemi mwe masulumizo yako na kawatenda wank'hondo wako watoge.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Nk'handula zo mzi wa Sayuni zamwiile Zumbe Mnungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Masozi nayetike enga mto kilo na msi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">wiile na kuhongeza haheina kuhumula!<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Kilo chose inuka ukaile naho mgambile Zumbe Mnungu ayo ye mwo moyo wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">Mlombezeleni wana wenyu, wana wakubanika kwa sala mwe sila!<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Kaula Zumbe Mnungu unifanyanye! Togola kuna yeyose umdamanyile enga suwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Togola hata wavele wa wana wawe wakuwaungisa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Togola walavant'hambiko wakomigwe mwe Nyumba yako?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Vimba va wabwanga na wadala vikegoneza hamwenga mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">wana kilume wangu na wana kike kuwakoma kwa sime yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">naho kuwakoma mwe dizuwa dya maya yako.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Kuwalalika mwe dizuwa dye kinyemi wank'hondo wangu awo wanitisaga kila nt'hendelo mwe dizuwa dya maya yako Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Hehali yeyose ahonile hegu kunyilika, wadya wana niwaleile na kuwakaulisa, mnk'hondo ywangu kawabananga.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Makunt'ho na makawiilo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Miye ni mnt'hu napataga makunt'ho, kwa maya yakwe Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Aniguhaga na kunigala hant'hu hana ziza naho hiyo ko ung'azi.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Kanisulumiza na kuinsulumiza kilo na msi.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Katenda nk'handa yangu na mavuha yangu vitulike.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Kanikup'hukila na kunizungulusila usungu wa makunt'ho.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Kanitenda nikale mwe diziza enga wadya wabanike kale.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Kanizungulusila nk'handula nisekunyilika, na kuninyinya kwa minyololo izamile.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />Hata uneva ninatowa lwasu hegu kulombeza wambizi nise kuzumilwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Kakindila sila yangu kwa maiwe makulu naho hikudaha kuita kokose.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Enga kala dikwitangwa dubu naho enga simba ikuninyatila.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Anibulumulaga kulawa mwe sila yangu, na kunileka haheina wambizi.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Avutaga uta wakwe na kunionyekeza miye.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Anilasaga no msale mwo moyo, msale ulaile mwe dichaka dyakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Hinda kint'hu cha kubelwa kwa want'hu wangu wose, msi wose hinda mnt'hu wakusekwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Kanimemeza makunt'ho, na kunitenda nindilise na usungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Kanitenda miye nigwegwejule meno yangu mwe zmp'halamba, na kkunifiligisa mwa maivu.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />Moyo wangu haumanyize utondowazi naho, kinyemi kwangu ni kint'hu hikimanyize.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Hingilisa chevu kawiilo dyangu hadihali naho.<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />Nayakumbukila makunt'ho yangu na kwangadika kwangu ni enga usungu wa sungwi.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Nayafanyanya ayo yose, na moyo wangu umema usungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Mna nakumbukila mbuli imwenga du, na miye nina kawiilo.<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />Suwe hakikomwa kwaviya lwa Zumbe Mnungu lukulisa, naho mbazi zakwe ni za mazuwa yose.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />Kila kukacha kwanda kuhya, uhuwilwa wakwe ni mkulu vitendese.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Zumbe Mnungu niye humuunga, ivo nenimwikile kawiilo dyangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />Zumbe Mnungu ni ywedi kwa wadya wakumhuwila na kwa wose wakuzungula wambizi wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Ni vedi mnt'hu kugojela kwa kufinyiliza, kwajili yo uyokozi wa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Ni vedi mnt'hu kuhina kufinyiliza akanda akei mbwanga.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />Ni vedi kwikala kwa kunyamala, umwo makunt'ho yakakumpata kulawa kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Yaungwa kufanamiza mtwi kwa kukeseleza, vadahika dikanda diaho kawiilo.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Hata kikatoigwa na kuhomolwa ni vedi kiyahokele yose.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu haakilemele mazuwa yose.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />Hamwenga na kugamba akitenda kinde na kinyulu, mna naakionele mbazi viligane no wingi wo uwedi wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Yehe hakuunga kuwasulumiza hegu kuwatenda want'hu wande na kinyulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Zumbe kamanya Wavugailwa wose mwe isi ivo wakahujilwa na kutendelwa yaihile,<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />amanya uwagilwa wa want'hu ivo ukwazwa ha Zumbe Mnungu mkulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />Na kumhoka mnt'hu uwagilwa wakwe, togola Zumbe Mnungu asekuona mbuli izi.<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Niani akudaha kulonga kint'hu kidamanyike, togola hiyo Zumbe Mnungu akudamanya ayo.<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Mbuli zedi na mbuli ziihile zalaila du kwa kuunga mwenye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Nii mnt'hu ande alabile, ikanda kasengelwa kwo wavu wakwe?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Naho kihime na kupelemba lugendo lwetu, vileke kidahe kumuuiya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Nekimwinuile Zumbe Mnungu myoyo hamwenga na mikono yetu kwa kumlombeza.<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />Suwe kidamanya wavu na kukuhituka mna weye hukiusile wavu.<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />Kukigubika kwa maya yako na kukikulumbuza niyo wakikoma haheina mbazi.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Kukesungulusila vunde dizamile, vileke kulombeza kwetu kusekukubwiila.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />Kukitenda kinde nt'hagata na usavu mgati mwa want'hu wa si nt'huhu.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />“Wank'hondo wetu wose wakitowa kizumo.<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />Kisulumila kwa wogohi na makunt'ho ya kipump'ha, ubanangi na ukomi.”<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />Meso yangu yatumbuka nc'hoko yo mto wa masozi, kwaviya yo kubananga want'hu wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />Meso yangu yalawa masozi haheina kuleka,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />mpaka aho Zumbe Mnungu naakaule hasi na kuona.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Naila na kuona usungu, haona yadya yawapatile wavele wa mzi wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Wadya wandile wank'hondo wangu haheina dyodyose wanongola enga dege.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Nawaniduula mwe dibome handa mgima, na mnanga mwakwe niyo waniduganyila maiwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Mazi nayakonga kugubika mtwi wangu, name hagamba uno nuwo uheelo wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Kulawa hasi ye dibome nehikuwiila weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Weye kwiva hakuiila, unase kuleka kwiva ndilo yangu halombeza wambizi.<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Umwo nakwitange nokwiza hagihi, ukagamba usekogoha.<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Zumbe ywangu kunigombela masa yangu na kukombola ugima wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Zumbe ywangu weye kuona uwihi nidamanyilwe, nilamuile masa yangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Weye kuona uwihi wa wank'hondo wangu na mizungu yawe yose mwa miye.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Zumbe ywangu kwiva ivo wakunihomola, na malongelezo yose yaihile mwa miye.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />Msi wose milosi na fanyanyi za wank'hondo wangu, ni kwa miye kunibananga.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Wakaule mwo lupisi lwose wakanda wekala hegu kukimala mwo ukemi wawe wakanibela.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />“Weye Zumbe Mnungu uwasengele kiya wakuwagilwa, kwaviya watendile.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Waligite vileke wapate makunt'ho!<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Kwaviya kuwafiila maya uwakulumbuze mpaka uwakome pele asekusigala hata yumwenga mwe isi!”<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kukint'ha kwo usengelo wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Ivo nivo zahabu yetu yazile ung'azi wakwe, naho zahabu yedi haikung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">na maiwe ya yombe kulawa mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu visambala mwe kila sila.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Wabwanga wa Sayuni watunyagwa vitendese, wakauliswe enga zahabu yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">nivo vili haluse vinda enga vyombo va ulongo, viumbigwe ni muumbi.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Hata uzi dyonk'heza wanawe, mna want'hu wangu wanda heweena mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">enga mbuguni kwe nyika.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Milomo ya wana wa mbuguni inyala kwa nk'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">walombeza nk'hande mna hehali akuwenk'ha.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Wadya nawakadya nk'hande zedi haluse wazehuka mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">Wadya nawakavala suke za zambalau, haluse wagona mwa maivu.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />Makunt'ho ya want'hu wangu ni makulu kujink'ha ya mzi wa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">mzi usunguzwe kubanangwa, haheina mnt'hu ywa kuwambiza.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Wakulu wawe wa Yelusalemu wang'alaga mbee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">miili yawe yandaga ink'hundu guu, na uwedi wawe enga valo dya samawiti.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Haluse futa zawe nt'hitu tii, wakomboka mwe sila hawakumanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">nk'handa zawe zimamatilana na mavuha, naho inyala enga nk'huni.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Wadya wakomigwe kwa sime ni wedi kujink'ha wadya wakubanika kwa sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">wasulumila kwa sala, mpaka wabanika.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />kwa mikono yawe wenye wavele awo wakundaga na mbazi wawaambikaga wana wawe wenye haheina mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">wakawatenda wande nk'hande yawe umwo want'hu wangu wakakomigwa. b<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />Zumbe Mnungu alagisaga maya yakwe yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">Na kuugela moto mzi wa Sayuni, moto uwo wokaga mazumba ne zink'hongelo zakwe zose.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Maseuta hawahuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">hegu wakaya wowose wa mwe isi kugamba nawakump'hukilwe hegu mnk'hondo naakadaha kwingila mwe nk'hili ya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Ayo nayalaila kwajili yo wavu wa walotezi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">Naho nayalaila kwajili yo uwihi wa walavant'hambiko wawe, kwaviya wawakomaga want'hu heweena malema.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Vilongozi wangadikaga mwe sila enga mant'hunt'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">hakwandile na yeyose wa kuwakwafya kwaviya mavalo yawe yajabalaga sakame za want'hu awo wawakomile.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />“Want'hu nawakawatoela lwasu wakagamba foseni!” mwite zenyu nyuwe mwili wasavu, “Foseni naho msekukikwafya!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Ivo wandaga want'hu wakwangadika uko na uko naho want'hu wa si nt'huhu walongaga hawahokelwe kwikala kwetu.<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />Zumbe Mnungu mwenye awatendaga wasambale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">Hakuwakaula naho na walavant'hambiko hawapate nt'hogola na vilongozi nawo hawatogolwe.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Nekisokela kwikala meso kugojela waambizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">Nekicheleza na kugojela kwa nk'hwina mwa want'hu hewekudaha kukiyokola.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Wank'hondo nawakakinyatila mwe sila niyo chadunduga kombokela mwe zisila zetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">Mazuwa yetu yandaga yajika na uheelo wetu wabulaga.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Awo nawakakitimila wandaga wahufu enga swaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">Wakigulusaga mwo mnima, naho wakinyatilaga mwe nyika.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />Nawamgwila yudya kikumhuwila mwo wikazi wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">yudya seuta asagulwe ni Zumbe Mnungu, yudya chagambaga mwo wamizi wakwe nekikale mwe ziisi.<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />Wakaya wa Edomu mwadaha kwanga ivi haluse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">Naho wakaya wa Uzi mwadaha kunda na kinyemi, mna usengelo uno wa makunt'ho nouweziileni na kuyahambula mavalo yenyu.<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Usengelo wo wavu wako mwa want'hu wa Sayuni ukint'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Zumbe Mnungu haawaleke msamesame, mna nyuwe Waedomu naawasengele mwo uwihi wenyu.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mbazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ukumbukile mbuli ziya zakipataga suwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:1">Naho ukaule ivo chagelagwa soni.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Isi yetu ink'higwa wata kwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">Na nyumba zetu kwa want'hu watuhu.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Kinda wana nk'hiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:3">mami zetu walekigwa enga wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Chaungwa kugula mazi yo kunywa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">Na k'huni zetu wenye nazo chagula.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Chatigizwa kudamanyisa ndima enga watumwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">Kisokela mna hakikuungwa kuhumula.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Kikelava kwa Wamisili na Waashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">Vileke kipate nk'hande.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Wakale wetu wadamanyaga wavu naho hawahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">Na suwe chasulumila kwaajili yo wavu wawe.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Watumwa nawo wakukilongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:8">Naho hehali wa kukiyokola.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Nk'hande yetu chaipata kwa kukelava wikazi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">kwaviya wakomi we kila hant'hu.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Nk'handa zetu zakweela moto enga tanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:10">kwajili ye sala ivo ikuchoka.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Wavele wetu wakakaliswa wagone nawo mwo mzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:11">Na wana kike wetu mwe zikaya za Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Vilongozi wetu waguhigwa na kuhwelezwa mnanga ne mikono yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:12">wadala wetu hawenk'higwe nt'hunyo yeyose.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Wabwanga watigizwa kusaga ulozo kwa maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">wabwanga nawo wangadika kwa mazilo ya nk'huni.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Wadala waleka kulava ulangilizi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:14">na wabwanga waleka kukema.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Kinyemi che mioyo yetu kisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:15">fugo zetu zihitula mahongezo.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Seuta nekikakeduvila hehali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:16">Hangi suwe wenye kwaviya kidamanya wavu.<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Kwajili iyo myoyo yetu ilumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">Naho kwa mbuli izo meso yetu yafinyafinya.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Kwaviya mnima Sayuni ulekigwa howiina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">Na mauzi yagendagenda uumwo.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu umwo Useuta wako ni mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">Kulongoza kwako ni mwa vyeleko na vyeleko.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Nii kukileka lupisi lutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">Nii kukijala mazuwa yose ayo?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Kivuze kwako weye Zumbe Mnungu, vileke naswe kikuwiiye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">Uvuze uhya nt'hunyo yetu enga aho kale.<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />Togola weye kukilemela vitendese?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:22">Hegu kukiihiya vitendese?<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>